  "training": {
    "hints": [
      "Translate the lesson into explicit state and permissive logic: The lamp uses exactly one selected rate and turns off when flash_enable is removed.",
      "Inputs are simulator feedback (flash_enable, fast_rate_selected, slow_rate_selected); PLC logic owns rate_lamp.",
      "Test the initial state, the valid condition, and at least one missing permissive."
